## 📱 Project Features Summary

### ✅ Core Features Implemented:

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Add Task** | Create tasks with title, description, priority, category, due date |
| **Delete Task** | Swipe to delete or tap delete button with confirmation |
| **Update Task** | Edit existing tasks via tap on task item |
| **View Tasks** | RecyclerView with filtering and sorting options |
| **Task Reminders** | AlarmManager-based notifications with proper Android permissions |
| **Priority System** | High, Medium, Low with color-coded indicators |
| **Categories** | 10 predefined categories (General, Work, Personal, etc.) |
| **Search** | Real-time search through task titles and descriptions |
| **Filter & Sort** | Filter by completion, priority; Sort by date, priority, alphabetical |
| **Persistence** | Room database for offline storage |

### 🏗️ Architecture:

- **MVVM Pattern** with ViewModel and LiveData/Flow
- **Clean Architecture** with separate layers (UI, Domain, Data)
- **Hilt** for Dependency Injection
- **Room** for local database
- **Coroutines** for asynchronous operations
- **Material Design 3** components

